; atleast_spin_model_k_above_n: a check that runs before the model type check
; still wins on a spin model.
;
; ATLEAST checks k against the index count before it reads the model register,
; so k = 3 over 2 indices raises IndexOutOfBounds as it did before
; NonBinaryModel existed. Only checks against the model itself come after the
; domain check.

PUSH 4
SQMX r0          ; spin model, 4 variables
VECI r1
PUSH 0
VECPUSH r1
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r1       ; indices = [0, 1]
PUSH 3           ; k = 3 > 2
PUSH 1           ; penalty
ATLEAST r0 r1
HALT
